  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The proposal to construct a single storey side  and front and  rear extension and rear roof extension to the existing dwelling house is inconsistent and out of character with the density and form of existing development in the vicinity of the site, would detract from the character of the street scene and surrounding area, and would compromise the living conditions / residential amenity of adjoining properties. The development fails to comply with Policies ENV B.1.1 (New Development) and H.6.4 (Extensions and Alterations) of the  Unitary Development Plan (adopted December 2003), and the relevant provisions of  Supplementary Planning Guidance \"Residential Extension Guidelines\"."
